## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design multi-tenant adapter routing, per-brand hyperparams, latency budgets, and robust evaluation in production-like settings.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-tenant adapters and per-brand routing
- Injection points: attention vs FFN
- PEFT families: LoRA, QLoRA
- 4-bit quantization and on-device vs server deployment
- Leakage, drift, and KB-grounded evaluation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Skeleton router
function route(query, brand, intent) {
  const adapterKey = `${brand}_${intent}`;
  const adapter = loadAdapter(adapterKey, brand);
  return adapter.infer(query);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you measure leakage and drift across brands?
- How would you automate per-brand hyperparameter tuning and rollback?
